        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "TheloNiQ5 is proven worldwide for its prowess in electrification and sustainability.With itsglobalaward-winningDNA,Hyundainowbeginsa pivotal journeywith the IoNIQ5robotaxi,a level 4 autonomous vehicle that can drivewithout a driver.More than3O sensors includingLiDAR,and a computing system allows therobotaxi to detect36o°and makeoptimaldecisions.Hyundai is beginning productionofthe IONIQ5robotaxi,which is set to launch inLas Vegas during the first halfof2024.",
